====Usage notes====
* Despite being part of the {{w|Soviet Union}}, the {{w|Byelorussian Soviet Socialist Republic|Byelorussian SSR}} was granted a code on the first publication of {{w|ISO 3166}} in 1974 due to being a member of the {{w|United Nations}}.

